{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55905","headline":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十二 · 居遁","name":"偈颂（幷序○序爲南岳齐己撰） 六十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"无端遣问墨池边，染得身衣黑似烟。\n却去上流清处洗，身心用尽亦如然。\n令教脱却重披素，不免依前着净缘。\n染净二途俱不了，到头须得自心玄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"居遁","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55905.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55905","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}